  doc = ~~~
Aspect-Oriented Tracing enables cross-cutting concerns without code pollution:

**Attachment Points:**
```rio
// Single point of attachment for all tracing
Actor auto_trace Ko
  Du check_executable
  Du trace_execution
  Du measure_performance
  Du record_learning_context
```

**Business Logic Preservation:**
```rio
// Original logic remains pure and focused
Actor Ko DoIts
  Du auto_trace      // Tracing aspect
  Du auto_validate   // Validation aspect  
  Du auto_optimize   // Optimization aspect
  // Pure business logic below
  C "// core implementation..."
  Its Element process_elements
  C "// more business logic..."
```

**Automatic Inheritance:**
Any new Ko type automatically gains:
- Execution tracing
- Performance monitoring
- Validation checking
- Optimization application
- Learning cycle integration

**Benefits:**
- **Maintainability**: Business logic stays focused
- **Consistency**: Uniform tracing across all operations
- **Extensibility**: New aspects attach universally
- **Future-Proof**: New KOs automatically instrumented

This pattern transforms cross-cutting concerns from maintenance burdens into composable capabilities.
~~~
}

